Package: claimslag
Title: Claims Lag Triangles, Completion Factors and IBNR for Healthcare Claims
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Sanika", "Kalvikatte", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Builds service-date to paid-date lag triangles from a paid-claims
    extract, develops chain-ladder completion factors per claim type, estimates
    IBNR (with a Bornhuetter-Ferguson fallback for immature months) and flags
    which incurred months are complete enough to report. Synthetic data only.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
